(MASTER SERVICES AGREEMENT) Tj T*
(Between Northwind Analytics Ltd. \("Provider"\) and Harbor Freight Logistics Inc. \("Customer"\).) Tj T*
(Effective Date: 1 March 2026.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Definitions) Tj T*
(1.1 "Services" means the hosted analytics services described in each Order Form.) Tj T*
(1.2 "Fees" means the amounts payable under each Order Form.) Tj T*
(1.3 "Term" means the Initial Term and every Renewal Term.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Term) Tj T*
(2.1 The Initial Term is twenty-four \(24\) months from the Effective Date.) Tj T*
(2.2 The Agreement renews for successive twelve \(12\) month Renewal Terms unless) Tj T*
(    either party gives written notice of non-renewal at least sixty \(60\) days) Tj T*
(    before the end of the current Term.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Fees and Payment) Tj T*
(3.1 Customer pays the Fees annually in advance, net thirty \(30\) days from invoice.) Tj T*
(3.2 Late amounts bear interest at one percent \(1%\) per month.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. Confidentiality) Tj T*
(7.1 Each party keeps the other's Confidential Information confidential during) Tj T*
(    the Term and for three \(3\) years after it ends.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
