(12. Limitation of Liability) Tj T*
(12.1 Neither party is liable for indirect or consequential damages.) Tj T*
(12.2 Each party's total liability is capped at the Fees paid in the twelve \(12\)) Tj T*
(     months before the claim, except for breach of Clause 7.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(14. Termination) Tj T*
(14.1 Either party may terminate for cause if the other party materially breaches) Tj T*
(     this Agreement and fails to cure the breach within thirty \(30\) days of) Tj T*
(     written notice.) Tj T*
(14.2 Customer may terminate this Agreement for convenience on ninety \(90\) days') Tj T*
(     written notice. If Customer terminates under this Clause 14.2 during the) Tj T*
(     Initial Term, Customer pays an early termination fee equal to fifty percent) Tj T*
(     \(50%\) of the Fees remaining for the Initial Term.) Tj T*
(14.3 Either party may terminate immediately if the other party becomes insolvent.) Tj T*
(14.4 Clauses 3, 7 and 12 survive termination. Prepaid Fees for the period after) Tj T*
(     termination are refunded, except on termination under Clause 14.2.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(15. Notices) Tj T*
(15.1 Notices must be in writing and sent by registered mail or by email to the) Tj T*
(     addresses on the signature page. Email notice is effective on confirmation) Tj T*
(     of receipt.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(16. Amendments) Tj T*
(16.1 Amendments bind only when signed by both parties.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
